ents. The same comment is never rewarded twice.</p><h2>Your information</h2><p>We store your account, comments, likes and points history. Your public name appears with approved comments; your email stays private. Your comment text, public name and news context are sent to local AI for review, without your email. The administrator can review comments and decisions. Please do not share private information in a comment.</p><p><a class="button secondary" href="/aanmelden?lang=en">Count me in ☀</a></p></section><section class="panel">@include('community.lightspot-guidelines')</section><section class="panel"><h2>{{ app()->getLocale()==='en'?'Sharing with care':'Delen met aandacht' }}</h2><p>{{ app()->getLocale()==='en'?'For adults aged 18 and over. Personal experiences of faith or recovery are welcome; no pressure, discrimination, medical advice or promised cures. Do not share identifiable sensitive details about others. Declare your own sensitive information and give separate consent when posting.':'Voor volwassenen van 18 jaar en ouder. Eigen ervaringen met geloof of herstel zijn welkom; geen druk, discriminatie, medisch advies of beloofde genezingen. Deel geen herkenbare gevoelige gegevens over anderen. Geef bij het schrijven eigen gevoelige informatie aan en geef daarvoor apart toestemming.' }}</p><p>{{ app()->getLocale()==='en'?'AI reviews and translates locally and can make mistakes. Doubtful contributions are reviewed by the administrator. Public contributions can be reported; contact us for privacy questions. This is not an emergency service.':'AI controleert en vertaalt lokaal en kan fouten maken. Twijfelgevallen beoordeelt de beheerder. Openbare bijdragen kun je melden; mail ons voor privacyvragen. Dit is geen hulpdienst.' }}</p><p><a href="/contact">Contact</a> · <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a></p></section>@endsection
